        <Text tone="muted" class="measure mb-10">
          Five flows covering the paths the screens sit on. Each splits what a
          person does from what the system does with it, because in a pipeline
          product the gap between those two is where the design decisions live.
        </Text>
        <div class="space-y-16">
          {flows.map((f, i) => (
            <Plate
